Original notes from Tuomas Lukka:


This is the development ground for the java scripting interface.

If the code is weird and non-idiomatic java, please tell me -- it's
my first java program. No, really, it is.

genfields.py generates the SF*, ConstSF*, MF* and ConstMF* classes in the
field/ subdirectory. genexceptions.py generates the Invalid*Exception
classes in this directory. Both scripts hold their own type tables.

They need Python 3.12 or later. Run them from this directory:

    python3 genfields.py
    python3 genexceptions.py
